{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026E5dl5cPZ861792811099.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國社科院在深圳舉辦「一國兩制」學術研討會。</p><p></p><p>開幕式在香港中文大學(深圳)舉行，中國社會科學院院長高翔、港澳辦原副主任、全國港澳研究會會長鄧中華、特首政策組組長黃元山等出席並致辭。</p><p></p><p>研討會以港澳五年規劃與融入服務國家發展大局為主題，設主論壇及三個分論壇，邀請了內地、港澳及海外的百多位專家學者出席，包括全國港澳研究會顧問譚耀宗、立法會前主席范徐麗泰等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:44:23.934653+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T17:38:04.804139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T04:38:11.828979+00:00","content_hash":"f4bae8dce71f17587b820cadd64c2996d16055ab8c6a198e4016c1849eb269c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:44:23.934653+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}